Weather and marine data are from Open-Meteo (https://open-meteo.com/), © Open-Meteo, licensed CC BY 4.0.
Tide predictions are from NOAA CO-OPS station 9684403 (Puntarenas), which NOAA places in the public domain.

Wet-bulb globe temperature is computed with James C. Liljegren's 2008 model.
The C implementation vendored in pipeline/vendor/liljegren/ is the source published
through mdljts/wbgt (Max Lieblich, MIT license, included in those files), which
packages the Argonne code.

This product includes software produced by UChicago Argonne, LLC
under Contract No. DE-AC02-06CH11357 with the Department of Energy.

The shore-energy model is a calculation, not a measurement. Reef crest height,
crest width, front slope, and the gap coefficient are guesses. See docs/source/design-spec-v1.md.
